OL,3,GNEWSAFarm attraction reopens with new
OL,4,Aowners
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular visitor site has reopened
OL,7,Funder new ownership after being closed
OL,8,Ffor almost a year.
OL,10,FOccombe Farm was bought by new owners
OL,11,FGreendale last month after being sold
OL,12,Fby Torbay Council.
OL,14,FThe site reopened on Wednesday,
OL,15,Fwelcoming visitors back to its farm
OL,16,Fkitchen, play barn, outdoor play areas
OL,17,Fand nature trails.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
