OL,3,GNEWSAFarm attraction reopens with new
OL,4,Aowners
OL,5,
OL,6,FDirector Tom Schwenn said it was
OL,7,F"absolutely amazing" to see people out
OL,8,Fin force adding: "We're asking people
OL,9,Fto bear with us - there's lots of
OL,10,Fexciting changes and fun things coming
OL,11,Fup in the near future."
